  the man beneath the armor clearly it was  loyalty to Lannister not a conspiracy  against the Targaryen  that led Purcell to bring about the mad  Kings downfall of course you could claim  that this seemingly doddery old man is  actually a master of deception and is  hiding his true involvement in a  conspiracy  we couldn't rule him out unless we could  really see what he was thinking  fortunately we get to do exactly that in  the case of Cresson maester Cressen  serves Stannis Baratheon at Dragonstone  and in the prologue of clash Crescent  tries to kill the red witch Melisandre  which looks exactly like the sort of  thing that someone would do if they were  part of a conspiracy against magic the  chapter is written from Crescent's point  of view so we get to see all the maces  thoughts that lead to his decision to  try to kill Mel and opposition to magic  and superstition is part of crescens  motivation a sort of ideological battle  goes on between Melisandre magic and  crescents denial of it but that's not  the main issue here Crescent does have  his doubts about magic and there's no  mention of any conspiracy  crescens main motivation is that he  wants to protect Stannis Crescent loves  Stannis thinks of him as the son he  never had and he feels that Melisandre  is leading Stannis astray by convincing  him to kill his brother and to sail to  war without having allies so while magic  is part of the issue here the main  reason Crescent tries to kill Mel is not  a mystic conspiracy against magic but a  fatherly love for Stannis so where does  this leave us the maesters could have a  lot of influence on the politics of  Westeros they may have good reasons to  oppose to our gate Aryans dragons and  magic lady Dustin suggests that a  maester was involved in the plot to  overthrow the Targaryen s' though we  don't really know what happened there  now in the major claims of the maesters  killed off the dragons which they might  have done indirectly by manipulating the  high towers to start the dance or maybe  by poisoning the last few dragons but we  really don't have any proof grand  maester pycelle and maester Cressen make  moves against Targaryen sand magic users  but those acts don't seem related to any  conspiracy so given the complete lack of  evidence a big conspiracy involving many  maesters seems quite unlikely Mowen's  claims are probably exaggerated  in fact he might have an ulterior motive  for scaring off Sam from telling the  Citadel about Daenerys however it's very  easy to believe that at least some arch  mesas of the Citadel strongly distrust  Targaryen dragons and magic and might  occasionally pull some strings to oppose  these things so the bottom line is that  there's probably some sneaky [ __ ] going  on we just don't know how much the good  news is that we'll probably find out  more in the next book  right now many awesome characters are  converging on the Citadel Sam tally has  been sent to study and earn the maesters  chain Jack and higer has come in  disguise and acquired a key said to  unlock every door in the Citadel Oberyn  Martell's bastard daughter Sorella has  come in disguise as the acolyte Alerus  and some of you on Greyjoy's Ironborn  have started raiding around old town  there are a lot of disguises going on a  lot of intrigue lot of mystery it's  going to be a lot of fun seeing how all  this turns out and what it might reveal  about the maesters thanks for watching  feel free to comment about what you  think the maesters are up to thanks also  to touch all Tina's who kindly helped  out with some imagery for the video he  had some really awesome art based on  Game of Thrones theories so you should  definitely check out his deviantART as a  link in the description finally thank  you to all the patrons including Nicoli  derek wing ADC 400 and alice katrell who  made it possible for all chief Dax to go  full-time this year thanks to your  support we're already using better  faster software and hardware and aiming  to release at least 2 or 3 videos per  month hopefully more so with a new Game  of Thrones season coming out in April  2016 is going to be big so happy new  year and see you next time
 

